M118 >>> square 1 (reference)
G1 X135 Y135 F9000
G1 X215 Y135 F9000
G1 X215 Y215 F9000
G1 X135 Y215 F9000
G1 X135 Y135 F9000
G1 X175 Y175 F9000

; ---------- swap 0 -> 1 ----------
M400
G4 P500                 ; known still period -- subtract from the trace gap
